          </constraints>
        </categoryLink>
      </categoryLinks>
    </forceEntry>
    <forceEntry id="10b2-a87d-e68e-0b8c" name="Legio Titanicus (Allied Contingent)" hidden="false">
      <rules>
        <rule id="c725-77fc-75bf-8b08" name="Army List" hidden="false">
          <description>Strategy Rating 3. Formation initiative 1+.
Each upgrade may only be taken once per formation.
Legio Titanicus has no Support Detachments.
Warhounds carry 2 Scout Titan weapons; Reavers 3 and Warlords 4 Scout or Battle Titan weapons. Arm/carapace mount restrictions are noted on each weapon.
The wiki sets no Allies/Lords of War points limit for Legio Titanicus.
Cohesive allies: Legion Astartes, Knight Household, Mechanicum Taghmata.
Disruptive allies: Imperial Militia, Solar Auxilia, Daemons Of The Ruinstorm.
Allied Contingent: formations here count towards the primary army's Allies &amp; Lords of War allowance. Supreme Commanders must come from the primary army.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="db68-b06e-e8a4-aae1" name="Allies" hidden="false" targetId="d6db-799f-23f8-2194" type="rule"/>
